### MCDT Milestone M3 Reflection Layer Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:25580
@token = test-token

### 1. Named root handles (minecraft, player, level, screen, options, gameRenderer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/objects/roots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 2. Inspect root 'minecraft' instance
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/objects/minecraft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 3. Inspect root 'options' instance
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/objects/options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 4. Inspect root 'gameRenderer' instance
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/objects/gameRenderer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 5. Inspect root 'screen' instance (live TitleScreen when in menu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/objects/screen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 6. Path traversal: query renderDistance on options from minecraft root
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/objects/minecraft?path=options.renderDistance().get()
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 7. Path traversal: query live client FPS
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/objects/minecraft?path=fps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 8. Expand specific field 'options' on minecraft root
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/objects/minecraft/fields/options?depth=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 9. Static class inspection: net.minecraft.client.Minecraft
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/classes/net.minecraft.client.Minecraft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 10. Static class inspection: java.lang.String
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/classes/java.lang.String
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 11. Security denylist verification: java.lang.Runtime (expected 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/classes/java.lang.Runtime
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 12. Release handle (replace {{handle}} with an allocated h_... handle)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/objects/h_12345678
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 13. Decompile class source: net.minecraft.client.Minecraft (remapped)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/classes/net.minecraft.client.Minecraft/source
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 14. Decompile class source (raw runtime bytecode, no remap)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/classes/net.minecraft.client.Minecraft/source?remap=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 15. Decompile class source (plain text output)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/classes/net.minecraft.client.Minecraft/source?format=text
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Accept: text/plain
